## 4. Tool Card Standard

Every tool card, wherever it appears (Category Hub, Homepage, Related Tools), uses the same reusable structure — never a one-off layout per tool:

```
[Icon]
Word Counter
Count words, characters, sentences, and reading time.
Open Tool →
```

Required fields: Icon, Tool name, Short description, Category, "Open Tool" button. This matches Master Spec Section 8.2 and `Design_System_v1.0.md` Section 11's Tool Card component exactly — reuse `.bn-tool-card`, do not create a new card class for category hub pages.

