## 5. Individual Tools = Blogger Posts (the single most important decision)

**Tools are never Static Pages.** Every tool is a Blogger **Post**:

```
Word Counter      → Blogger Post → /2026/08/word-counter.html
JSON Formatter    → Blogger Post
Image Compressor  → Blogger Post
```

This keeps tool count independent of Blogger's 20-Page limit, and is what makes scaling to 200+ tools possible at all — this is the Master Spec's core platform constraint (Section 0), not a stylistic choice.

